    <custom_item>
      type        : REGISTRY_SETTING
      description : "1.212 WN16-SO-000090"
      info        : "The setting Domain member: Digitally encrypt secure channel data (when possible) must be configured to enabled.

GROUP ID: V-225030
RULE ID: SV-225030r958908

